Lab UI is extracted from AgentCraft Worlds (https://github.com/larattalabs/agentcraft-worlds), the
Laratta Labs fork of AgentCraft by blendi-remade (https://github.com/blendi-remade/agentcraft), both MIT.
Extraction source: agentcraft-worlds commit 1966066 (2026-10-09). Only the package (dev.larattalabs.labui.*)
and the resource namespace (lab_ui) were changed, plus the seams listed in README.md "What changed in the move".

